      <VERS vnumber="7">For the <gr str="4399">things </gr>they had were <gr str="1767">sufficient </gr>for all the <gr str="4399">work </gr>to <gr str="6213">make </gr>it, and too <gr str="3498">much</gr>.</VERS>
